      "title": "When Kubernetes restarts your pod — And when it doesn&#8217;t",
      "url": "https://www.cncf.io/blog/2026/03/17/when-kubernetes-restarts-your-pod-and-when-it-doesnt",
      "publishedAt": "2026-03-17T11:00:00+00:00",
